# Local-only neighbours of the project: the user's own voice recordings
# (`voice-agent/*.wav`), a side experiment that keeps a plaintext key
# (`mini-agent/.deepseek-key`), design mockups and scratch test scratch.
# None of it belongs to Clicky, and a stray `git add -A` would publish all of
# it — so it is blocked here rather than left to be noticed at commit time.
voice-agent/
mini-agent/
design-preview/
.tmp-open-test/

# 屏幕 OCR 的调试产物：截图和它的全文识别结果。**里面是用户屏幕上的真实内容**
# （窗口标题、正文片段），推到 GitHub 就等于把这些内容公开出去 —— 和这个文件里
# 挡住 voice-agent / mini-agent 是同一个理由，只是内容更贴脸。
# 工具在 tools/截图与OCR/，产物不入库。

# 截图与OCR 的编译产物 —— README 自己写的「build.sh 生成，不入库」。
tools/截图与OCR/ocr
截图-左侧-*.png
截图-左侧-*.txt
屏幕文字-*.txt

# The running app appends to its own run log, so the newest one is never stable.
开发经验/运行日志/clicky-冷重开验证-20260924-123505.log
